### Core Banking Refactoring Lab - reproducible demo requests
###
### Uses the VS Code "REST Client" extension conventions (# @name + {{name.response.body.$.field}}).
### To compare legacy vs refactor, change only @baseUrl below.

@legacyBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@refactorBaseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api/v1
@baseUrl = {{refactorBaseUrl}}

### 1. Create customer
# @name createCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CC",
  "documentNumber": "1234567890",
  "fullName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

### capture customerId
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Create SAVINGS account
# @name createSavingsAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "SAVINGS"
}

### capture savingsAccountId
@savingsAccountId = {{createSavingsAccount.response.body.$.id}}

### 3. Create CHECKING account
# @name createCheckingAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "CHECKING"
}

### capture checkingAccountId
@checkingAccountId = {{createCheckingAccount.response.body.$.id}}

### 4. Deposit 200000 COP into the SAVINGS account
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{savingsAccountId}}",
  "amount": 200000.00
}

### 5. Transfer 75000 COP from SAVINGS to CHECKING (SAVINGS transfer fee = 1000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{savingsAccountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{checkingAccountId}}",
  "amount": 75000.00
}

### 6. Check source account balance (expected 124000.00)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{savingsAccountId}}/balance

### 7. Check destination account balance (expected 75000.00)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{checkingAccountId}}/balance

### 8. Check SAVINGS account transaction history
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{savingsAccountId}}/transactions

### 9. Block the SAVINGS account (State pattern demo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{savingsAccountId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "BLOCKED"
}

### 10. Invalid case: attempt a withdrawal on the now-blocked SAVINGS account
### Expected: 422 UNPROCESSABLE_CONTENT with code ACCOUNT_BLOCKED
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{savingsAccountId}}",
  "amount": 10000.00
}
